{"version":1,"content":"<p>男神吳彥祖（Daniel）依家中美兩邊走，既攻打荷里活，又會客串內地幕前工作等，真係忙到爆。</p><p>近日佢作客成都網紅「老白小破屋」，同老白一齊復刻二十多年前經典電影《新警察故事》中跳上車嘅名場面，更於現場為老白做動作指導。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T02:18:55.693694+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T00:50:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T02:12:15.409285+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T02:12:15.409285+00:00","content_hash":"279d2c00bf39c733850d279573f580d769dce31ccac3b791d61eae5f670708de","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}